A. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/17034302b5a3e78069d940727a69b4e370a3f10cc6a91c9b35478f1c569df32b.png","width":275,"height":305,"width_mm":32.167,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\nB. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e8030900467e12215b984d41f42f948f17e712bec3d7db51742dd833ecc6a484.png","width":287,"height":291,"width_mm":33.691,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q14-row5"},{"type":"text","value":"\nC. "},{"type":"figure","src":"images/cd25669b4375b047036f840d7f08fd6a344d8a74e729de3b9d85990b0721f780.png","width":288,"height":285,"width_mm":33.691,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q14-row5"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第14题参考答案：（共14分）\n14-I（共6分）\n(1) C ; (1 分)\n(2) 38.80; (1 分) 9.63（或 9.62） (1 分)\n(3) 10.19； (2分) C (1分)\n14—II（共3分）\n(1)"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{LK}{PQ}"},{"type":"text","value":"；（2 分）\n（2）B；（1 分）\n14—III（共5分）\n（1）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{A}_2"},{"type":"text","value":"; (1分)\n(2) 8.0 (±0.1); (1分) 191 (±5) (2分)\n(3) A ; (1 分)"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505-q15","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505","source_question_id":"zhuji-moni-2505-q15","number":"15","order":15,"type":"计算题","topics":["热学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"aa1ea72bc954d8034b191271c5e39b1a2b23866492021fa4804489a23b28be36","body":[{"type":"text","value":"15. （8分）如图甲所示，潜水钟倒扣沉入水中，钟内存有一定量的空气供潜水员呼吸。现将潜水钟简化为横截面积 "},{"type":"math","value":"S=4.0\\mathrm{m}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、高度L=3.0m的薄壁圆筒，如图乙所示，筒内装有体积可以忽略的电热丝和温度传感器（图中未画出）。现将开口向下的圆筒由水面上方缓慢竖直吊放至水下某一深度，此时圆筒内的液面与水面的高度差h=5.0m，该过程传感器显示筒内气体温度始终为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{1}=300K"},{"type":"text","value":" 。接着通过电热丝对筒内气体加热，同时逐渐竖直向上提升圆筒，使圆筒内液面与水面的高度差始终保持h值不变，当圆筒提升 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L=40cm"},{"type":"text","value":" 时，传感器显示筒内气体温度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。已知筒内气体的质量保持不变，其内能与温度的关系式为U=kT，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"k=1.0\\times10^{4}\\mathrm{J/K}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，大气压强为 "},{"type":"math","value":"p_{0}=1.0\\times10^{5}\\mathrm{Pa}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，水的密度 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\rho=1.0\\times10^{3}\\mathrm{kg/m^{3}}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g=10\\mathrm{m/s^{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n(1) 在圆筒缓慢向下吊放过程中, 筒内气体的内能（填空）（“增大”、“不变”、“减小”), 筒内气体的分子数密度（填空）（“增大”、“不变”、“减小”）;\n(2) 求筒内气体的温度 "},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）求圆筒提升 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L"},{"type":"text","value":" 过程中筒内气体吸收的热量 "},{"type":"math","value":"Q"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0480bff6a3ddb0eaab751616e65cfdfef3a1a48d793047f9436ab489c3f3fb7c.png","width":351,"height":311,"width_mm":41.152,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第 15 题图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/a7ab93a7fb8b18f409e5dae21477708bcba730d7a137aa0e8e721a49e721cf69.png","width":328,"height":340,"width_mm":38.431,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q15-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第15题图乙"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 15 题参考答案：（共 8 分）\n(1) 不变\n(1 分)\n增大；\n(1 分)\n（2）设圆筒到达某一深度时筒内空气长度"},{"type":"math","value":"L_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，此过程等温变化，由玻意耳定律"},{"type":"math","value":"p _ {0} S L = (p _ {0} + \\rho g h) S L _ {1}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"L _ {1} = 2.0 \\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"圆筒向上提升过程为等压变化，由盖-吕萨克定律"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {S L _ {1}}{T _ {1}} = \\frac {S (L _ {1} + \\Delta L)}{T _ {2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"T _ {2} = 360 \\mathrm{K}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）在圆筒竖直提升"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta L"},{"type":"text","value":"的过程中，设气体对外做功为"},{"type":"math","value":"W"},{"type":"math","value":"W = - (p _ {0} + \\rho g h) S \\Delta L"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"W = - 2.4 \\times 10 ^ {5} \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"内能变化"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = k \\Delta T"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = 6 \\times 10 ^ {5} \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"由热力学第一定律:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta U = Q + W"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"Q = 8.4 \\times 10 ^ {5} \\mathrm{J}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n【编校注】原答案文字写“设气体对外做功为 W”。原答案的负功及热力学第一定律写法中，W 实际表示外界对气体做的功。"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505-q16","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505","source_question_id":"zhuji-moni-2505-q16","number":"16","order":16,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"2072c59a269c6407b2e318e8fdc75b0b89e0e9f5810a4acbb2c36c27c6d2f7c5","body":[{"type":"text","value":"16. （11分）如图所示，游戏装置由光滑倾斜轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"AB"},{"type":"text","value":" 、半径 "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 2\\sqrt{3}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的光滑圆弧轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"BC"},{"type":"text","value":" 、长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 9.0\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 和高为 "},{"type":"math","value":"h = \\sqrt{3}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 光滑高台 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 构成，倾角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的直角斜面体紧贴着高台边缘 "},{"type":"math","value":"ED"},{"type":"text","value":" ，且与高台 "},{"type":"math","value":"EF"},{"type":"text","value":" 等高。现将质量 "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.5\\mathrm{kg}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的小物块从倾斜轨道上高度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"H = 4\\sqrt{3}\\mathrm{m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的 "},{"type":"math","value":"A"},{"type":"text","value":" 处由静止释放，小物块恰好能到达高台边缘 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点。若斜面体向左移动，固定在 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 间的任一位置，小物块仍从同一高度 "},{"type":"math","value":"H"},{"type":"text","value":" 处由静止释放，发现小物块从斜面体顶端斜抛后也恰好落在 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 点。已知小物块与水平轨道 "},{"type":"math","value":"CD"},{"type":"text","value":" 和与斜面体之间的动摩擦因数均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" ，小物块可视为质点，不计空气阻力，重力加速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10\\mathrm{m / s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n（1）求小物块到达圆弧轨道最低点 C 时对轨道压力的大小；\n（2）求动摩擦因数 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu"},{"type":"text","value":" 和斜面体倾角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（3）在高台 EF 上放置表面光滑、质量 M=2.0kg 的 “小山坡”，小物块以速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=2.0m/s"},{"type":"text","value":" 冲向 “小山坡”，设小物块始终贴着 “小山坡” 表面运动，求 “小山坡” 获得的速度。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/9dc6dd02922b6f4b9c67af9cf7ca97f0312d845e7d57e458156e42b5c8651cab.png","width":1071,"height":309,"width_mm":125.79,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q16-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第16题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 16 题参考答案：（共 11 分）\n（1）小物块到达圆弧轨道最低点"},{"type":"math","value":"C"},{"type":"text","value":"时速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{C}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由机械能守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"m g H = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {C} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n小物块在圆弧轨道最低点 C 时，由向心力公式"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {N} - m g = m \\frac {v _ {C} ^ {2}}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F _ {N} = 25 \\mathrm{N}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（2）小物块由 A 到 E 的过程中，由能量关系"},{"type":"math","value":"m g (H - h) = \\mu m g \\cdot L"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu = \\frac {H - h}{L} = \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{3}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设斜面体与平台相距为"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"，小物块到"},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":"点的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\mathrm{E}}"},{"type":"text","value":"，由能量关系"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {E} ^ {2} = \\mu m g \\cdot x"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {E} = \\sqrt {2 \\mu g x}"},{"type":"text","value":"根据斜抛运动的规律"},{"type":"math","value":"x = v _ {E} \\cos \\theta \\cdot t"},{"type":"math","value":"t = 2 \\frac {v _ {E} \\sin \\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"x = v _ {E} \\cos \\theta \\cdot 2 \\frac {v _ {E} \\sin \\theta}{g} = \\frac {v _ {E} ^ {2} \\cdot \\sin 2 \\theta}{g}"},{"type":"text","value":"代入得"},{"type":"math","value":"x = \\frac {2 \\mu g x \\cdot \\sin 2 \\theta}{g} = 2 \\mu x \\cdot \\sin 2 \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"即："},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 2 \\theta = \\frac {1}{2 \\mu} (\\theta \\text{与} x \\text{无关})"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n则："},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin 2 \\theta = \\frac {\\sqrt {3}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta = 30 ^ {\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）小物块从“小山坡”返回或越过“小山坡”，满足动量守恒和机械能守恒"},{"type":"math","value":"m \\mathbf {v} _ {0} = m \\mathbf {v} _ {1} + M \\mathbf {v} _ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {1}{2} m v _ {0} ^ {2} = \\frac {1}{2} m v _ {1} ^ {2} + \\frac {1}{2} M v _ {2} ^ {2}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {1} = 2.0 \\mathrm{m/s};\\quad v _ {2} = 0"},{"type":"text","value":"或"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {1} = - 1.2 \\mathrm{m/s};\\quad v _ {2} = 0.8 \\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"① 若小物块不能越过 “小山坡”，则 “小山坡” 获得的速度为 0.8m/s （1 分）\n② 若小物块能够越过 “小山坡”，则 “小山坡” 获得的速度为 0\n(1 分)"},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n【编校注】原解取示意图中的较小倾角 30°。按原解所用模型，题面文字给出的直角斜面也允许另一锐角解 60°，它同样满足"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin(2\\theta)=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"。两个倾角对应的斜面底边分别为 3 m 和 1 m，都可置于 9 m 的水平轨道上。"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505","source_question_id":"zhuji-moni-2505-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["力学","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"4188b090f4223b6a64282fb2a02d8801b580b6f05521bee886b6c394e3b1cd1b","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（12分）如图所示，两个光滑刚性正方形金属线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{2}B_{2}C_{2}D_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 交叠固定在光滑水平面上，交叠点 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 恰好为两边中点，且彼此相互绝缘。在两线框交叠区域存在着垂直纸面向里、磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场（交叠的金属线框在磁场边缘以内）。已知两线框质量均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" ，边长均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"a"},{"type":"text","value":" ，单位长度电阻均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r_0"},{"type":"text","value":" 。现将匀强磁场在极短的时间内减小为零，不计线框电感。\n（1）判断线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 中感应电流方向(“顺时针”或“逆时针”)，并求流过截面的电量；\n（2）求线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{2}B_{2}C_{2}D_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 受到安培力冲量的大小和方向；\n（3）若线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 不固定，交叠点 "},{"type":"math","value":"E"},{"type":"text","value":" 和 "},{"type":"math","value":"F"},{"type":"text","value":" 不彼此绝缘（接触电阻不计），而且线框所在平面整个区域都存在着匀强磁场 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求匀强磁场减小为零时线框 "},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" 速度的大小。（忽略磁场减小过程中线框的移动）\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/122e514f317e2ce20335e3e7110a2bc0f2a34cefc7b2caa1c38e9c52cc5a5819.png","width":612,"height":358,"width_mm":71.783,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q17-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第17题图"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 17 题参考答案：（共 12 分）\n（1）线框"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"中感应电流的方向：顺时针（1 分）\n由法拉第电磁感应定律和闭合回路欧姆定律："},{"type":"math","value":"E = \\frac {\\Delta \\Phi}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {S \\Delta B}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {B _ {0} a ^ {2}}{4 \\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac {E}{R} = \\frac {E}{4 a r _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n流过截面的电量"},{"type":"math","value":"q = I \\Delta t = \\frac {B _ {0} a}{16 r _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（2）线框"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{2}B_{2}C_{2}D_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"受到安培力冲量的方向：向左（1 分）\n设某时刻线框的电流为 i，则"},{"type":"math","value":"i = \\frac {e}{R} = \\frac {a}{16 r _ {0}} \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"线框受到安培力的冲量"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\text{安}} = \\sum B i L _ {\\mathrm{EF}} \\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\text{安}} = \\sum B \\cdot \\frac {a}{16 r _ {0}} \\cdot \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\cdot \\frac {\\sqrt {2}}{2} a \\cdot \\Delta t = \\frac {\\sqrt {2} a ^ {2}}{32 r _ {0}} \\sum B \\cdot \\Delta B"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"I _ {\\text{安}} = \\frac {\\sqrt {2} a ^ {2} B _ {0} ^ {2}}{64 r _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）根据两环对称性，设某时刻两线框电流"},{"type":"math","value":"i_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"和"},{"type":"math","value":"i_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"如图所示。"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/ff61d1b18cb5c2f09e8a76cf0e4016bfc0f6d34176abc9a96889e16104db91e6.png","width":572,"height":369,"width_mm":72.5},{"type":"text","value":"设回路"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}EA_{2}D_{2}C_{2}FC_{1}B_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"中的电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"E _ {1} = \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\frac {7 a ^ {2}}{4} = i _ {1} \\cdot 6 a r _ {0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"i _ {1} = \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\frac {7 a}{24 r _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"设回路"},{"type":"math","value":"ED_{1}FB_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"中的电动势为"},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则"},{"type":"math","value":"E _ {2} = \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\frac {a ^ {2}}{4} = i _ {2} \\cdot 2 a r _ {0}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得"},{"type":"math","value":"i _ {2} = \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\frac {a}{8 r _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"【或：对于"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"："},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1} = \\frac{\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} a^{2} = i_{1}\\cdot 3ar_{0} + i_{2}\\cdot ar_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"】\n由于"},{"type":"math","value":"i_{1} > i_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，线框"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"所受安培力的合力方向向左，速度方向向左。\n设线框"},{"type":"math","value":"A_{1}B_{1}C_{1}D_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"获得速度大小为 v，利用动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum B (i _ {1} - i _ {2}) \\frac {\\sqrt {2}}{2} a \\Delta t = m v - 0"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum B \\cdot \\frac {\\Delta B}{\\Delta t} \\frac {a}{6 r _ {0}} \\frac {\\sqrt {2}}{2} a \\Delta t = m v - 0"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {\\sqrt {2} a ^ {2}}{12 r _ {0}} \\sum B \\cdot \\Delta B = m v"},{"type":"text","value":"解得:"},{"type":"math","value":"v = \\frac {\\sqrt {2} B _ {0} ^ {2} a ^ {2}}{24 r _ {0} m}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--zhuji-moni-2505","source_question_id":"zhuji-moni-2505-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["近代物理","电学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"0b672a3396c3093344b4e41638973047f1403f401c762432eb1cfbd7430fafe2","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （13分）如图甲所示是托卡马克装置的结构示意图，其主要包括环形真空室、极向场线圈、环向场线圈等，在环形真空室内注入少量氢的同位素氘和氚，提高温度使其发生聚变反应。如图乙所示为环形真空室的示意图，它的轴线半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"r"},{"type":"text","value":" ，横截面的圆半径为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，假设环形真空室内粒子质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"+q"},{"type":"text","value":" ，粒子碰到真空室的室壁立即被吸收。【提示：空间角是三维空间中的角度度量，用于描述从一个点出发所能观察到的立体角，半顶角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 的圆锥形发散空间角为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2\\pi (1 - \\cos \\theta)"},{"type":"text","value":" 】\n（1）写出氘和氚核聚变的核反应方程式；\n（2）若粒子以 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 速度沿真空室轴线做匀速圆周运动，求极向场线圈产生磁场的大小；\n（3）将装置中相邻环向场线圈简化为两个平行线圈，通电后在真空室内产生磁感应强度为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场，如图丙所示。位于两个线圈轴线中点的粒子源O向右侧各个方向均匀发射速度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}=\\frac{5qB_{0}R}{8m}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的粒子。\n① 若某粒子发射时速度方向与 x 轴的夹角 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=37^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，求该粒子做螺旋线运动的螺距；\n② 求粒子源发出的粒子没有被室壁吸收的百分比 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":" ;\n（4）实际装置的环向场线圈产生类似“磁瓶”形状的非匀强磁场来约束粒子，如图丁所示。已知沿轴线方向的磁感应强度最大和最小的关系为： "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{\\max}=k_{1}B_{\\min}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，在粒子运行过程中，垂直轴线方向速度的平方与沿轴线方向的磁感应强度的大小之比为一常数，即 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{v_{\\perp}^{2}}{B_{x}}=k_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。位于轴线中点的粒子源O向右侧各个方向均匀发射粒子（所有粒子均没有碰到室壁），求粒子能被约束在“磁瓶”内的比例 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/0611b0d3c11b88e95949b8a45a77ef3adadf280de2a1b017ef4bf9240863b9e7.png","width":401,"height":249,"width_mm":47.003,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图甲\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/aa69f3f23d11edb27924524dd9fdafa852ad066d2163dd28a08729c0f94fb6cf.png","width":324,"height":270,"width_mm":38.031,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q18-row1"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图乙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/1d52aaa68e0b972b58a22f47da11810963cac6972ef657c212de63fc5a9d2914.png","width":493,"height":276,"width_mm":57.925,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图丙\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/55fe3c17b6eecfddbebe289fe975ccea1e32e604e1679c9f7f4fc13d4f2ef413.png","width":602,"height":283,"width_mm":70.602,"row_group":"zhuji-moni-2505-q18-row2"},{"type":"text","value":"\n第18题 图丁"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"第 18 题参考答案：（共 13 分）\n(1) 氘和氚核聚变的核反应方程式"},{"type":"math","value":"{ } _ { 1 } ^ { 2 } \\mathrm{H} + { } _ { 1 } ^ { 3 } \\mathrm{H} \\rightarrow { } _ { 2 } ^ { 4 } \\mathrm{He} + { } _ { 0 } ^ { 1 } \\mathrm{n}"},{"type":"text","value":"（2 分）\n（2）设极向场线圈产生的磁场大小为 B，洛伦兹力提供向心力"},{"type":"math","value":"q v _ {0} B = m \\frac {v _ {0} ^ {2}}{r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"B = \\frac {m v _ {0}}{q r}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（3）带电粒子与 x 轴成"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"角射入环向磁场，粒子沿螺旋线运动。\n① 设粒子垂直轴向做圆周运动的周期为 T，则"},{"type":"math","value":"T = \\frac {2 \\pi m}{q B _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n设粒子沿轴向上做匀速运动的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":"，则螺距："},{"type":"math","value":"L = v _ {x} T = \\frac {2 \\pi m v _ {0} \\cos \\theta}{q B _ {0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"得："},{"type":"math","value":"L = \\pi R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n② 粒子垂直轴向上做匀速圆周运动，设粒子刚好碰到室壁的角度为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"math","value":"q v B = m \\frac {v ^ {2}}{r}"},{"type":"math","value":"r = \\frac {1}{2} R"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"},{"type":"math","value":"v _ {\\perp} = v _ {0} \\sin \\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"即："},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin \\theta = \\frac {q B _ {0} R}{2 m v _ {0}} = \\frac {4}{5}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n粒子源发出的粒子没有被室壁吸收的百分比"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_ {1} = \\frac {2 \\pi (1 - \\cos \\theta)}{2 \\pi} \\times 100 \\%"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_ {1} = 40 \\%"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n（4）中点 O 处的磁场最弱，设在 O 处发射粒子的速度为 v，与轴线夹角为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"；“磁瓶”的“瓶颈”处磁场最强，粒子运动到此处时速度方向恰好与轴线垂直，则粒子能够被约束在“磁瓶”内，因为洛伦兹力不做功，粒子速度大小始终为 v。根据题意可知\n由"},{"type":"math","value":"k_{2}=\\frac{v_{\\perp}^{2}}{B_{x}}"},{"type":"text","value":"得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac {v ^ {2}}{B _ {\\max}} = \\frac {(v \\sin \\theta) ^ {2}}{B _ {\\min}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n即："},{"type":"math","value":"\\sin^ {2} \\theta = \\frac {B _ {\\min}}{B _ {\\max}} = \\frac {1}{k _ {1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n则角度大于"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"的粒子能被约束在“磁瓶”内"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_ {2} = \\frac {2 \\pi - 2 \\pi (1 - \\cos \\theta)}{2 \\pi}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）\n得:"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta_ {2} = \\cos \\theta = \\sqrt {\\frac {k _ {1} - 1}{k _ {1}}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1 分）"}]}}]}
